# scripts/opcount (from the repository root, NAME ../benchmarks/apifirst/cli/ergo):
# `clibench bench N` runs the generated command line of counter.Counter N
# times over a cycle of seven command lines (values, --json, typed
# failures, a positional argument, a usage error); the cost of one run is
# the slope between the two sizes. The control is the hand Go command
# line of API-FIRST spec §3's CLI row: a switch, a flag.FlagSet per
# command, strconv and an append JSON writer.
unit run
sizes 20000 220000
args bench {n}
control benchmarks/apifirst/cli/control
